WEBVTT

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:04.130
What do you think, we are going to leave
for our children and grand children?

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.930
What is the future of technology
according to you?

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:09.780
It is very exciting.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:12.780
Today we use computers 
like we use smartphones,

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:16.110
but if you fast forward 
many years from now,

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:20.960
I think, computing and the world's 
knowledge will be there with you

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.760
wherever you go.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:26.210
You get into your car, your home,
maybe even on your body.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:29.190
It will be there, anytime,
waiting to help you.

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:31.440
I think that will be big.